@LojaPesca.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5046

### Get all products
GET {{LojaPesca.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### Get product by ID
GET {{LojaPesca.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get products by category
GET {{LojaPesca.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/category/Varas
Accept: application/json

###

### Search products by name
GET {{LojaPesca.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/search?name=Vara
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new product
POST {{LojaPesca.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vara de Pesca Profissional",
  "description": "Vara de pesca de fibra de carbono",
  "price": 299.90,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "Varas",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/vara.jpg"
}

###

### Update a product
PUT {{LojaPesca.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vara de Pesca Atualizada",
  "description": "Vara de pesca de fibra de carbono atualizada",
  "price": 349.90,
  "stock": 20,
  "category": "Varas",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/vara-updated.jpg"
}

###

### Delete a product
DELETE {{LojaPesca.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}

###
